%% Sequence: who calls whom, in what order, for ONE flow. At most 7 participants and 25 messages.
%% Participants named as in the code. New steps sit inside rect + Note; error branches in alt / else.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant UI as Checkout page
    participant API as Orders API
    participant R as Discount rules
    participant DB as Orders DB

    C->>UI: Enters promo code, presses Apply
    rect rgb(227, 244, 232)
        Note over UI,R: New in this task
        UI->>API: POST /orders/:id/promo
        API->>R: validate(code, cart)
        alt code valid
            R-->>API: discount
            API->>DB: save discount on the order
            API-->>UI: 200, new total
            UI-->>C: Total with discount
        else code unknown or expired
            R-->>API: rejection reason
            API-->>UI: 422, reason
            UI-->>C: Inline error
        end
    end
